    "Imports your full Last.fm scrobble history into the local database so the Recap and Year in Music cover everything you've ever played.": {},
    "In library as %@ — get it lossless": {},
    "In published blind tests — the largest public one put 580 participants on CD versus 256 kbps AAC — most listeners cannot reliably tell 256 kbps AAC from lossless. Only a small minority succeed, on specific tracks, under ideal conditions, on revealing gear. Apple itself calls the difference “virtually indistinguishable”.": {},
